   519	// N1/N3: the devices one sync_and_release_all_impl call synchronized, with each result. Fixed capacity, no allocation.
   520	// A device beyond the capacity is still synchronized; its failure is remembered only as `spill_failed`, which makes
   521	// every unrecorded device count as failed (conservative: its not-yet-complete entries are leaked, never released).
